{"seq":1,"slug":"search-graph-representation","title":"搜索与图表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/search-graph-representation","wordCount":1592,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"搜索与图表示\">搜索与图表示</h1><p>让一个角色&quot;走到那边&quot;，引擎做的第一件事不是几何计算，而是把整个可行走世界压缩成一张抽象的图——节点是&quot;角色可以处在的离散位置&quot;，边是&quot;从一个位置一步能到达另一个位置&quot;，边权是&quot;这一步的代价&quot;。一旦世界变成图，寻路就退化成一个被研究了七十年的经典问题：在带权图上求两点间的最短路。这一篇讲清楚图从哪里来、长什么样，以及在它上面有哪些朴素搜索可选——它是本 hub 后续每一篇的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>寻路图的三种主流表示，对应三种把连续世界离散化的策略，它们的差异决定了内存占用、路径质量与生成成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    W[连续可行走世界] --&gt; G[栅格 Grid&lt;br/&gt;规则方格 4/8 邻接]&#10;    W --&gt; P[路点图 Waypoint Graph&lt;br/&gt;手工/自动撒点连边]&#10;    W --&gt; N[导航网格 Navmesh&lt;br/&gt;凸多边形覆盖表面]&#10;    G --&gt; S[统一接口: 节点 + 邻接 + 边权]&#10;    P --&gt; S&#10;    N --&gt; S&#10;    S --&gt; A[图搜索算法: BFS / Dijkstra / 贪心 / A*]\">graph TD\n    W[连续可行走世界] --&gt; G[栅格 Grid&lt;br/&gt;规则方格 4/8 邻接]\n    W --&gt; P[路点图 Waypoint Graph&lt;br/&gt;手工/自动撒点连边]\n    W --&gt; N[导航网格 Navmesh&lt;br/&gt;凸多边形覆盖表面]\n    G --&gt; S[统一接口: 节点 + 邻接 + 边权]\n    P --&gt; S\n    N --&gt; S\n    S --&gt; A[图搜索算法: BFS / Dijkstra / 贪心 / A*]</pre><p>无论底层是栅格、路点还是 navmesh，搜索算法看到的都是同一套抽象：给定一个节点，能枚举它的邻居及到每个邻居的代价。把这层接口抽干净，搜索算法就能与世界表示彻底解耦——这正是为什么同一个 A* 实现既能跑栅格也能跑 navmesh。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方式</th>\n<th>节点含义</th>\n<th>内存</th>\n<th>路径质量</th>\n<th>动态更新</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>栅格（Grid）</td>\n<td>一个方格</td>\n<td>高（与面积成正比）</td>\n<td>锯齿，需平滑</td>\n<td>极易（改格子标志位）</td>\n<td>2D、塔防、像素 RTS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路点图（Waypoint）</td>\n<td>一个航点</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>受撒点密度限制</td>\n<td>难（连边需重算）</td>\n<td>老式 FPS、早期 3D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导航网格（Navmesh）</td>\n<td>一个凸多边形</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（配漏斗算法）</td>\n<td>中（tile 局部重建）</td>\n<td>现代 3D 游戏主流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"栅格表示与邻接选择\">栅格表示与邻接选择</h2><p>栅格是最直观的离散化：把世界铺满边长固定的方格，每格要么可走要么阻挡。它的全部表达力压在&quot;邻接关系&quot;这一个选择上。四邻接（上下左右）只允许直角移动，路径呈曼哈顿式拐折；八邻接额外允许四个对角方向，更自然，但带来两个坑：对角移动的真实距离是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.414</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}\\approx1.414</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.414</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，边权必须区分，否则路径会偏短；以及&quot;穿墙角&quot;问题——两个阻挡格在对角相邻时，若允许从它们的对角缝隙穿过，角色会贴着墙角抄近道，看起来像穿模，需要显式禁止。</p>\n<p>栅格的杀手锏是动态更新近乎免费：放置一个建筑只需把覆盖的格子标记为阻挡，无需重算任何连边。代价是内存随面积线性膨胀，一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4096</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4096\\times4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span> 的地图就是一千六百万节点，这也是大地图必须上<a href=\"../practice/hierarchical-pathfinding\">分层寻路</a>的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路点图与导航网格\">路点图与导航网格</h2><p>路点图把世界抽象成稀疏的&quot;可站立点&quot;加它们之间的&quot;可直达连线&quot;。早期 FPS（如《雷神之锤》系列）靠关卡设计师手工撒点连边，运行期开销极小，但路径只能在预设点之间折线移动，撒点稀疏处角色会绕远、走出不自然的折线。它本质是栅格的极度稀疏化，今天主要作为历史遗产存在。</p>\n<p>导航网格则是当前 3D 游戏的主流（详见<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-generation\">导航网格生成</a>）。它不离散成点或方格，而是用一组互不重叠的凸多边形精确覆盖所有可行走表面，相邻多边形共享一条边即视为可通行。搜索图的节点是多边形（或多边形的边/中心），邻接由共享边定义。它的优势是节点数远少于等面积栅格、能精确贴合斜坡与不规则地形，配合<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding\">漏斗算法</a>能产出真正的最短折线路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"朴素图搜索-bfs-dijkstra-贪心\">朴素图搜索：BFS、Dijkstra、贪心</h2><p>有了图，最先想到的搜索是广度优先（BFS）。它从起点逐层向外扩展，第一次触及目标时的路径在&quot;边权全相等&quot;的图上即最短。但游戏地图边权不等（对角更贵、沼泽更慢），BFS 不再保证最优。</p>\n<p>Dijkstra 修正了这点。它维护一个按累计代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 排序的优先队列，每次取出当前代价最小的节点扩展，已确定最短代价的节点不再更新。它保证在非负边权图上找到最短路，但它&quot;盲目&quot;——不知道目标在哪，向四面八方均匀扩散，扩展的节点数远多于必要。值得一提：Dijkstra 从单一源点向全图扩散得到&quot;每点到源的最短代价&quot;这一性质，正是<a href=\"../practice/flow-fields-crowds\">流场</a>群体寻路的算法内核。</p>\n<p>贪心最佳优先（Greedy Best-First）走向另一个极端：完全用&quot;到目标的估计距离&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 排序，只朝目标方向猛冲。它通常扩展极少节点、速度快，但完全忽略已走代价，遇到凹形障碍会被骗进死胡同、绕大远路，不保证最优。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选取下一个扩展节点的依据] --&gt; B{排序键是什么?}&#10;    B --&gt;|g: 已走代价| C[Dijkstra&lt;br/&gt;最优但慢, 盲目扩散]&#10;    B --&gt;|h: 到目标估计| D[贪心&lt;br/&gt;快但不最优, 易陷阱]&#10;    B --&gt;|f = g + h| E[A*&lt;br/&gt;最优且高效]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选取下一个扩展节点的依据] --&gt; B{排序键是什么?}\n    B --&gt;|g: 已走代价| C[Dijkstra&lt;br/&gt;最优但慢, 盲目扩散]\n    B --&gt;|h: 到目标估计| D[贪心&lt;br/&gt;快但不最优, 易陷阱]\n    B --&gt;|f = g + h| E[A*&lt;br/&gt;最优且高效]</pre><p>Dijkstra 只看身后，贪心只看前方——把两者相加，正是<a href=\"a-star-algorithm\">A* 算法</a>的核心思想。它用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=g(n)+h(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 同时权衡&quot;已经走了多少&quot;和&quot;还要走多少&quot;，既保留 Dijkstra 的最优性保证，又借贪心的方向感大幅削减扩展节点。理解了这三种朴素搜索的取舍，A* 就不再是黑魔法，而是水到渠成的折中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>寻路的第一步永远是把连续世界离散成图：节点、邻接、边权三件套，搜索算法只依赖这层抽象，与世界表示解耦。</li>\n<li>三种表示各有取舍：栅格内存大但动态更新免费、路点图稀疏轻量但路径粗、navmesh 精确贴地是现代 3D 主流。</li>\n<li>八邻接栅格要小心对角边权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与穿墙角问题。</li>\n<li>BFS 只适合等权图；Dijkstra 最优但盲目扩散；贪心快但易陷凹形陷阱。</li>\n<li>Dijkstra 的&quot;全图代价场&quot;是流场寻路的内核，三种朴素搜索的取舍直接催生了 A*。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>站内进阶：<a href=\"a-star-algorithm\">A* 算法</a> —— 把 Dijkstra 与贪心合二为一。</li>\n<li>站内进阶：<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-generation\">导航网格生成</a> —— navmesh 这种图表示如何自动生成。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/pathfinding/graph-search-basics\">游戏 AI · 图搜索基础</a> —— 决策层视角下的同一主题入门。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/spatial-acceleration\">碰撞检测 · 空间加速结构</a> —— 同样把空间离散化以加速查询。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搜索与图表示","id":"搜索与图表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"栅格表示与邻接选择","id":"栅格表示与邻接选择"},{"level":2,"text":"路点图与导航网格","id":"路点图与导航网格"},{"level":2,"text":"朴素图搜索：BFS、Dijkstra、贪心","id":"朴素图搜索-bfs-dijkstra-贪心"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"A* 算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/a-star-algorithm"}}